        "text": "# AND (`&&`)\n\n**AND (`&&`)** is a logical operator used in conditional statements. \n\nFor a condition using **AND** to be true, **all** parts of the condition must be true. \n\n| A | B | A && B |\n|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| T | T | T |\n| T | F | F |\n| F | T | F |\n| F | F | F |\n\n\n\n\n",
